WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.122
The CIS Controls are a collection of cybersecurity safeguards and recommended practices designed to improve security posture.

2
00:00:08.122 --> 00:00:15.336
They focus on practical defensive measures that organizations can implement to address common threats and operational risks.

3
00:00:15.336 --> 00:00:19.686
The controls are widely used because they are actionable and understandable.

4
00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:24.605
They help teams move from broad security concern to specific improvement activities.

5
00:00:24.605 --> 00:00:28.766
The CIS Controls are not a software product or a single tool.

6
00:00:28.766 --> 00:00:34.952
They are a set of practices that can guide planning, operations, governance, and continuous improvement.
